test_check_zklogin_issuer() {
L0:	address#1#0: address
L1:	address_seed#1#0: u256
L2:	iss#1#0: String
L3:	other_iss#1#0: String
B0:
	0: LdConst[0](address: 0x1c..)
	1: StLoc[0](address#1#0: address)
	2: LdConst[1](vector<u8>: "htt..)
	3: Call string::utf8(vector<u8>): String
	4: StLoc[2](iss#1#0: String)
	5: LdU256(3006596378422062745101035755700472756930796952630484939867684134047976874601)
	6: StLoc[1](address_seed#1#0: u256)
	7: CopyLoc[0](address#1#0: address)
	8: CopyLoc[1](address_seed#1#0: u256)
	9: ImmBorrowLoc[2](iss#1#0: String)
	10: Call zklogin_verified_issuer::check_zklogin_issuer(address, u256, &String): bool
	11: BrFalse(13)
B1:
	12: Branch(15)
B2:
	13: LdU64(13906834268832661503)
	14: Abort
B3:
	15: LdConst[2](address: 0x00..)
	16: CopyLoc[1](address_seed#1#0: u256)
	17: ImmBorrowLoc[2](iss#1#0: String)
	18: Call zklogin_verified_issuer::check_zklogin_issuer(address, u256, &String): bool
	19: Not
	20: BrFalse(22)
B4:
	21: Branch(24)
B5:
	22: LdU64(13906834281717563391)
	23: Abort
B6:
	24: CopyLoc[0](address#1#0: address)
	25: LdU256(1234)
	26: ImmBorrowLoc[2](iss#1#0: String)
	27: Call zklogin_verified_issuer::check_zklogin_issuer(address, u256, &String): bool
	28: Not
	29: BrFalse(31)
B7:
	30: Branch(33)
B8:
	31: LdU64(13906834294602465279)
	32: Abort
B9:
	33: LdConst[3](vector<u8>: "htt..)
	34: Call string::utf8(vector<u8>): String
	35: StLoc[3](other_iss#1#0: String)
	36: MoveLoc[0](address#1#0: address)
	37: MoveLoc[1](address_seed#1#0: u256)
	38: ImmBorrowLoc[3](other_iss#1#0: String)
	39: Call zklogin_verified_issuer::check_zklogin_issuer(address, u256, &String): bool
	40: Not
	41: BrFalse(43)
B10:
	42: Branch(45)
B11:
	43: LdU64(13906834307487367167)
